000301  *>
000302  *> Module specific
000303  *>
000304   01  To-Day              pic x(10).
000305  *>
000306   procedure division.
000307  *>=================
000308  *>
000309   Payroll-Main.
000310  *>
000311  *> Force Esc, PgUp, PgDown, PrtSC to be detected
000312  *>
000313       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_EXCEPTIONS" to "Y".
000314       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_ESC" to "Y".
000315       move     current-Date to WSE-Date-block.
000316  *>
000317       perform  forever
000318                accept   WS-Env-Lines   from lines
000319                if       WS-Env-Lines < 28
000320                         display  SY010    at 0101 with erase eos
000321                         accept   WS-Reply at 0133
000322                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
000323                         exit perform cycle
000324                end-if
000325                accept   WS-Env-Columns from Columns
000326                if       WS-Env-Columns < 80
000327                         display  SY013    at 0101 with erase eos
000328                         accept   WS-Reply at 0130
000329                         move     8 to WS-Term-Code
000330                         exit perform cycle
000331                end-if
000332       end-perform.
000333  *>
000334       perform  zz020-Get-Program-Args.
000335  *>
000336   Open-System.                *> First get system param cobol file
000337       move     zeros to File-System-Used
000338                         File-Duplicates-In-Use.
000339       move     "00" to  FA-RDBMS-Flat-Statuses.  *> Force Cobol proc.
000340       move     1 to File-Key-No.
000341       perform  System-Open-Input.
000342       if       FS-Reply not = zero
000343   *>             perform System-Close       called again in aa010
000344                move     "sys002" to WS-Called    *> create param file by requested info from user
000345                call     WS-Called using WS-Calling-Data
000346                                         File-Defs
000347                perform  System-Open        *>  ditto
000348       end-if.
GnuCOBOL 3.2.0          payroll.cbl                                                   Sun Apr 19 2026 18:08:19  Page 0029

LINE    .....................................................SOURCE.....................................................

000349  *>
000350   aa010-Get-System-Recs.
000351       move     zeros to File-System-Used         *> again in case RDB setup
000352                         File-Duplicates-In-Use.  *> if sys002 just been run.
000353       move     "00" to  FA-RDBMS-Flat-Statuses.  *> Force Cobol proc.
000354   *>    move     5 to File-Key-No.                 *> Do when pre-testing complete
000355   *>    perform  System-Read-Indexed.              *> Read Cobol file payroll params if included
000356   *>    move     System-Record to PY-Param1-Record.
000357  *>
000358       move     1 to File-Key-No.
000359       perform  System-Read-Indexed.             *> Read Cobol file params
000360       if       FS-Reply not = zero              *> should NOT happen as done in
000361                perform System-Close             *> open-system
000362                move    "sys002" to WS-Called    *> create param file by requested info from user
000363                call     WS-Called using WS-Calling-Data
000364                                         File-Defs
000365                perform  System-Open
000366                go to aa010-Get-System-Recs
000367       end-if.
000368  *>
000369       perform  System-Close.
000370  *>
000371  *>   Back to work as we have the RDB rec if in use otherwise the Cobol one
000372  *>    regardless the system file/table is now closed with recs saved in WS.
000373  *>
000374       move     Run-Date to u-bin.          *> Set up by py000
000375       call     "maps04" using maps03-ws.
000376       move     U-Date to To-Day.
000377       perform  zz060-Convert-Date.  *> O/P = WS-Date
000378  *>
000379   *>    if       not P-Y
000380   *>             set P-Y to true.
000381  *>
000382       if       op-system = zero
000383                move "O/S" to Op-Display.
000384       if       linux   move "Linux"   To Op-Display
000385       else if  Windows move "Windows" To Op-Display
000386       else if  Mac     move "Mac"     To Op-Display
000387       else if  OS2     move "OS/2"    To Op-Display
000388       else if  unix    move "Unix"    To Op-Display
000389       else if  dos     move "Dos"     To Op-Display.
000390  *>
000391       if       Dos or Windows
000392                move WindoWS-Backup-Script-Name to Script-Name
000393       else if  OS2
000394                move OS2-Backup-Script-Name to Script-Name
000395       else if  Linux or Unix or Mac
000396                move Linux-Backup-Script-Name to Script-Name.
000397  *>
000398       string   ACAS_BIN     delimited by space
000399                OS-Delimiter delimited by size
000400                Script-Name  delimited by space  into Run-Backup
GnuCOBOL 3.2.0          payroll.cbl                                                   Sun Apr 19 2026 18:08:19  Page 0030

LINE    .....................................................SOURCE.....................................................

000401       end-string
000402       call     "CBL_CHECK_FILE_EXIST" using Run-Backup
000403                                             File-Info
000404       end-call
000405       if       Return-Code not = zero
000406  *>          and Batch-Text (1:1) not = space
000407                move "No BackUp Script in Bin" to Batch-Text
000408       else
000409                move 1 to Backup-Sw
000410                string "Using "    delimited by size
000411                       Script-Name delimited by space into Batch-Text
000412       end-if
000413  *>
000414       move     zeros to WS-Process-Func
000415                         WS-Sub-Function.
000416       if       Menu-Reply = "A"            *> menu run for 1st time in run unit ONLY
000417                go to Load01.
000418  *>
000419  *> now check for PY param file & rec  as we have system-rec.
000420  *>
000421       open     input PY-Param1-File.
000422       if       PY-PR1-Status not = zero      *> Does not exist yet so lets create it etc
000423                close PY-Param1-File
000424                go to Load25.
000425       close    PY-Param1-File.
000426  *>
000427   Display-Menu.
000428       display  Usera at 0101 with erase eos foreground-color 3.
000429       move     To-Day to U-Date.
000430       move     "payroll" to WS-Caller.
000431       move     spaces to WS-Called
000432                          WS-Del-Link
000433                          Menu-Reply.
000434       move     zeros to WS-Term-Code.
000435       move     Maps-Ser-nn to Curs2.
000436       display  Maps-Ser-xx at 2474 with foreground-color 3.
000437       display  Curs2 at 2476 with foreground-color 3.
000438       display  "Copyright (c) 2025-" at 2401 with foreground-color 3.
000439       display  WSE-Year at 2420 with foreground-color 3.
000440       display  " Applewood Computers" at 2424 with foreground-color 3.
000441  *>
000442   Conv-Date.
000443  *>
000444  *> Convert from UK to selected form
000445  *>
000446       if       Date-Form not > zero and < 4
000447                move 1 to Date-Form.
000448       if       Date-USA
000449                move U-Date to WS-Date
000450                move WS-Days to WS-Swap
000451                move WS-Month to WS-Days
000452                move WS-Swap to WS-Month
GnuCOBOL 3.2.0          payroll.cbl                                                   Sun Apr 19 2026 18:08:19  Page 0031

LINE    .....................................................SOURCE.....................................................

000453                move WS-Date to U-Date
000454       end-if
000455       if       Date-Intl
000456                move "ccyy/mm/dd" to WS-Date   *> swap Intl to UK form
000457                move U-Date (7:4) to WS-Intl-Year
000458                move U-Date (4:2) to WS-Intl-Month
000459                move U-Date (1:2) to WS-Intl-Days
000460                move WS-Date to U-Date
000461       end-if.
000462  *>
000463   Conv-Date-End.
000464       display  U-Date at 0171 with foreground-color 3.
000465  *>
000466   Display-Go.
000467       display  prog-name at 0301 with foreground-color 2.
000468       display  "Payroll System Menu" at 0333 with foreground-color 2.
000469  *>
000470       accept   wsb-time from time.
