000080C               display SY008           at 1210 with foreground-color 3 highlight
000081C               accept ws-reply         at 1243
000082C               stop run
000083C      end-if
000084C      if       Arg-Test (1:13) = "ACAS_LEDGERS="
000085C               move FUNCTION TRIM (Arg-Test (14:487), TRAILING) to ACAS_LEDGERS  *> 31/05/23
000086C      end-if
000087C *>
000088C *> arg-test can have one or more chars after 'stnnn' to control called programs processes
000089C *>  the first is compulsory:
000090C *>  For st040 it is 5 to clear period totals or month within year values down.
000091C *>   2nd digit is what to clear 1 = period, 2 = month within year, 3 = both.
000092C *>
000093C      move     spaces to Arg-Test.
000094C      unstring Arg-Vals delimited by space
000095C                into Arg-Test
000096C                with pointer z.
