000760  *>  Converts date in binary to UK/USA/Intl date format
000761  *>****************************************************
000762  *> Input:   u-bin
000763  *> output:  WS-Date as uk/US/Inlt date format
000764  *>          U-Date & WS-Date = spaces if invalid date
